-- Oli-- G2 assembler, hand-encoded x86-64. Built only with hex2.
-- Input: 0x410000 (1MiB); output: 0x510000 (1MiB).
-- State: 0x40f000 calls flag; +8 entry count; +16 machine count.
-- rbx cursor, r10 end, r15 output size, r9 state, r14 descriptor.
-- Two passes: symbols at 0x610000, then rel32/absolute resolution.
-- Output is a single RX segment; data/bss and narrower operands are pending.
7f 45 4c 46 02 01 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
02 00 3e 00 01 00 00 00
78 00 40 00 00 00 00 00
40 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00
40 00 38 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
01 00 00 00 07 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 40 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 40 00 00 00 00 00
2f 20 00 00 00 00 00 00 -- p_filesz = 8239
00 00 22 00 00 00 00 00 -- p_memsz
00 10 00 00 00 00 00 00
